          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Khulwako khuriitsenje, mbu haundi, kata olwa obusuubisie bushiliho obwokhwinjila mubuhuluushibwe, omundu yesi khwinywe aleshe okhulolekha shinga ouchweyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila toto mwene, ifwe khweelwatsilwa Amakhuwa amalayi shinga bo; ne likhuwa elia bahulila shiliabakaasila eshindu ta, shichila khubahulili beene shiliatsokana nobusuubili tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ifwe abasuubila khwinjilanga mubuhuluushi tsana obusungwakhwo burio, mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
